      ":question/problem": "Express $\\cos\\left(x-\\frac{3\\pi}{4}\\right)$ in terms of $\\sin x$ and $\\cos x$. Enter the signed coefficients.\n\n$\\cos\\left(x-\\frac{3\\pi}{4}\\right)=$ {{field-1}} $\\sin x\\,+$ {{field-2}} $\\cos x$",
